NAME "Automatic Smelting"

-- Label Furnaces as "furnaces" and Blast Furnaces as "blastfurnaces".
-- Label Input Chest for Ore and Fuels as "inputchest" and Output Chest for your Cooked Items as "outputchest".

EVERY 90 SECONDS DO

INPUT FROM inputchest

OUTPUT 8 EXCEPT modern_industrialization:lignite_coal, minecraft:coal TO EACH furnaces, blastfurnaces TOP SIDE
OUTPUT RETAIN 4 modern_industrialization:lignite_coal, minecraft:coal TO EACH furnaces, blastfurnaces NORTH SIDE

FORGET

INPUT FROM furnaces, blastfurnaces BOTTOM SIDE
OUTPUT TO outputchest

END